  "raw_text": "{\"fixture_id\":\"World-Cup_Group-Stage-9_Ivory-Coast_Ecuador_2026-06-14\",\"model_id\":\"gpt-5\",\"setting\":\"S2\",\"submitted_at\":\"2026-06-13T12:00:00Z\",\"reasoning\":{\"overall\":\"科特迪瓦整体身体对抗、边路冲击和定位球威胁较强，近年在非洲大赛的防守韧性也不错；厄瓜多尔则通常在跑动强度、边翼推进和中场覆盖上更均衡，且近几届世界杯周期的防线组织较稳定。两队绝对实力接近，杯赛首轮普遍更谨慎，预计比赛前段试探较多。对位上，科特迪瓦会更多依赖边锋与前插边后卫制造传中和二点球，厄瓜多尔则更可能通过高机动中前场打转换，利用速度冲击科特迪瓦中卫身后。考虑双方都具备一定个人能力但终结稳定性并非顶级，平局概率略高，1比1是较协调的结果。\",\"t1_result\":\"双方实力层级接近，首轮小组赛容错率仍在，先求不败的动机较强，因此我把平局放在最高概率。厄瓜多尔反击效率略好，但科特迪瓦身体和定位球优势足以抵消，故给出1-1。\",\"t2_player\":\"科特迪瓦预计以更直接的4-3-3/4-2-3-1思路出战，进攻核心更可能来自边路与中锋支点；厄瓜多尔则偏向4-3-3，依靠 Caicedo、Kendry Páez 一类中场连接者和 Enner Valencia 的终结经验。两队首发会尽量以熟悉框架为主，减少首战失误。\",\"t3_events\":\"比赛节奏大概率是上半场谨慎、下半场开放一些，进球更可能出现在两队体能下降后。若一方先领先，另一方也具备通过换人和边路提速追回的能力，黄牌主要来自中场拦截与边路回追。\",\"t4_stats\":\"我预计控球会比较接近，厄瓜多尔略占球权但不会形成压制。两队射门数应在中等区间，科特迪瓦的角球和对抗数据略高，厄瓜多尔的传球成功率略优，这与一场均势小组赛的面貌一致。\"},\"win_probs\":{\"home\":0.319,\"draw\":0.364,\"away\":0.317},\"headline_score\":\"1-1\",\"expected_goal_diff\":0,\"match_profile\":\"normal\",\"expected_total_goals\":2.34,\"lineups\":{\"home\":{\"starting\":[{\"name\":\"Yahia Fofana\",\"position\":\"GK\"},{\"name\":\"Wilfried Singo\",\"position\":\"DF\"},{\"name\":\"Odilon Kossounou\",\"position\":\"DF\"},{\"name\":\"Evan Ndicka\",\"position\":\"DF\"},{\"name\":\"Ghislain Konan\",\"position\":\"DF\"},{\"name\":\"Franck Kessié\",\"position\":\"MF\"},{\"name\":\"Jean Michaël Seri\",\"position\":\"MF\"},{\"name\":\"Seko Fofana\",\"position\":\"MF\"},{\"name\":\"Nicolas Pépé\",\"position\":\"FW\"},{\"name\":\"Sébastien Haller\",\"position\":\"FW\"},{\"name\":\"Simon Adingra\",\"position\":\"FW\"}],\"bench\":[{\"name\":\"Badra Ali Sangaré\",\"position\":\"GK\"},{\"name\":\"Ousmane Diomande\",\"position\":\"DF\"},{\"name\":\"Wilfried Boly\",\"position\":\"DF\"},{\"name\":\"Christian Kouamé\",\"position\":\"FW\"},{\"name\":\"Karim Konaté\",\"position\":\"FW\"},{\"name\":\"Ibrahim Sangaré\",\"position\":\"MF\"},{\"name\":\"Jonathan Bamba\",\"position\":\"FW\"},{\"name\":\"Maxwel Cornet\",\"position\":\"FW\"},{\"name\":\"Serge Aurier\",\"position\":\"DF\"},{\"name\":\"Lazare Amani\",\"position\":\"MF\"},{\"name\":\"Hamed Traorè\",\"position\":\"MF\"},{\"name\":\"Bénie Traoré\",\"position\":\"FW\"}]},\"away\":{\"starting\":[{\"name\":\"Hernán Galíndez\",\"position\":\"GK\"},{\"name\":\"Angelo Preciado\",\"position\":\"DF\"},{\"name\":\"Félix Torres\",\"position\":\"DF\"},{\"name\":\"Piero Hincapié\",\"position\":\"DF\"},{\"name\":\"Pervis Estupiñán\",\"position\":\"DF\"},{\"name\":\"Moisés Caicedo\",\"position\":\"MF\"},{\"name\":\"Carlos Gruezo\",\"position\":\"MF\"},{\"name\":\"Kendry Páez\",\"position\":\"MF\"},{\"name\":\"Gonzalo Plata\",\"position\":\"FW\"},{\"name\":\"Enner Valencia\",\"position\":\"FW\"},{\"name\":\"Kevin Rodríguez\",\"position\":\"FW\"}],\"bench\":[{\"name\":\"Alexander Domínguez\",\"position\":\"GK\"},{\"name\":\"Moisés Ramírez\",\"position\":\"GK\"},{\"name\":\"Willian Pacho\",\"position\":\"DF\"},{\"name\":\"José Hurtado\",\"position\":\"DF\"},{\"name\":\"Ángel Mena\",\"position\":\"FW\"},{\"name\":\"Jeremy Sarmiento\",\"position\":\"FW\"},{\"name\":\"Jordy Caicedo\",\"position\":\"FW\"},{\"name\":\"Alan Franco\",\"position\":\"MF\"},{\"name\":\"Jhegson Méndez\",\"position\":\"MF\"},{\"name\":\"John Yeboah\",\"position\":\"FW\"},{\"name\":\"João Ortiz\",\"position\":\"MF\"},{\"name\":\"Leonardo Campana\",\"position\":\"FW\"}]}},\"formations\":{\"home\":\"4-3-3\",\"away\":\"4-3-3\"},\"scorers\":[{\"player\":\"Sébastien Haller\",\"team\":\"home\",\"minute_range\":[46,75],\"p\":0.261},{\"player\":\"Enner Valencia\",\"team\":\"away\",\"minute_range\":[46,80],\"p\":0.278},{\"player\":\"Simon Adingra\",\"team\":\"home\",\"minute_range\":[15,60],\"p\":0.184},{\"player\":\"Kendry Páez\",\"team\":\"away\",\"minute_range\":[20,70],\"p\":0.131}],\"assisters\":[{\"player\":\"Simon Adingra\",\"team\":\"home\",\"p\":0.177,\"minute\":58},{\"player\":\"Pervis Estupiñán\",\"team\":\"away\",\"p\":0.171,\"minute\